@startuml OrbitalMechanics
interface IOrbitalMechanics
class OrbitalMechanics <<final>> {
  + orbital_period(semi_major_axis, mu) : double
  + vis_viva(r, semi_major_axis, mu) : double
  + sync_orbit_altitude(body) : std::optional<double>
  + soi_max_altitude(body) : std::optional<double>
}
class CelestialBody <<struct>>
OrbitalMechanics ..|> IOrbitalMechanics
OrbitalMechanics ..> CelestialBody : reads radius, mu,\nrot_period, soi
note right of OrbitalMechanics
  Stateless. All methods are
  closed-form, O(1), no I/O.
end note
@enduml
